      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0120_student1_01",
      "hash64": "239060DACFFB83B7",
      "text": "Carmine went to the festival?! W-we’re supposed\\nto be partners, but she didn’t even invite me...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0120_student2_01",
      "hash64": "4F9748E131655FA0",
      "text": "The guidebook I read said that the Festival of\\nMasks has a really long history.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0120_student3_01",
      "hash64": "FA4D94EB4071A715",
      "text": "We got to Kitakami just in time for a festival?!\\nHow lucky is that!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
